a protracted ; great\natony. Menses and leucorrhoea profuse."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"skin","label":"Skin","startLine":9370,"endLine":9372,"text":"Discoloration of skin in women with men-\nstrual and uterine disorder."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"extremities","label":"Extremities","startLine":9373,"endLine":9377,"text":"Severe drawing, cratic pain and stiff-\nness in small joints, fingers, toes, ankles, etc. Aching\nin wrists. Cutting pains on closing hands. Erratic\npains, changing place every few minutes."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":9378,"endLine":9382,"text":"Incompatible : Coffca.\n\nCompare: Viol. Odor, (rheumatic carpal and meta-\ncarpal joints) ; Cimicif.; Sepia: Piilsat.; Gels."}],"corpusPassages":[{"source":"corpus_aa7e2fa5c089","passageId":"pass_dae90a99f3cd7abd843a","ordinal":4805,"text":"Compare Caul., Lilium, Puis., Colo,, Ign."}]}